RANGE RATIONALE AND PENDING WORK
Per-field limits, physical/operating assumptions, and actual training bounds are documented in input_limits.json; outside-training acceptance results are in outside_training_range.json. Exact hardware specifications were not provided; these are broad, explicit engineering assumptions.
Timing boundaries: parse includes awaiting the body and Pydantic validation; normalise includes ordered feature extraction and scaling; inference includes tensor conversion/network execution/output conversion; build includes nonnegative clipping, rounding and response-body assembly. server_total spans run() for valid requests and excludes FastAPI routing, final JSON serialization, socket transport and network latency. Each stage is rounded to 0.001 ms; stage-sum checks allow 0.003 ms rounding error.
Swagger HTML/schema and equivalent API payloads are checked automatically. Interactive Swagger use is explicitly pending because no browser automation tool is available.
